  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5201</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……はぁ、やっぱ人生
苦手な事や、したくねぇ事からは
逃げられねぇのか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*sigh* I guess there's just no running
from the things you hate most in life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5202</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……そうだねぇ。
お兄ちゃんは、何度も溺れるし
わたしは高いトコから落ちるし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true. You keep getting
thrown in the water and I'm
always falling from high places.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5203</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>つまり『美味しいご飯が怖い』って
思えば、ごちそうにめぐりあう
運命になるって事じゃない!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*sigh* ...Oh! Does that mean if I think
“I'm terrified of yummy food,”
fate will hand me a buffet?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7084</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5204</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よ〜し！
わたし今から、ごちそうが
超〜〜〜苦手になるよ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All right! I'll have you know I'm just
SOOO scared of a tasty meal!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5205</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お前の、そのポジティブ思考……
兄ちゃん、喜んでいいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know where you get that
positivity from, but... Guess your
brother should just be happy for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
